WEBVTT

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:54.200
It's just as I thought, these Shadows
aren't used to aerial battles.

00:01:54.566 --> 00:01:55.626
In that case...

00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:57.926
I don't know about that!

00:01:59.166 --> 00:01:59.826
What?!

00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:04.303
A makeshift tactic won't work!

00:02:08.266 --> 00:02:09.896
We're counting on you, Marumaro!

00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:15.166
There!

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.000
Feather Protect!

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:22.800
Not just yet.

00:02:23.433 --> 00:02:24.103
What?!

00:02:25.233 --> 00:02:25.903
Oh no!

00:02:26.866 --> 00:02:28.426
Saber Tiger!

00:02:31.666 --> 00:02:34.026
Blitz Claw!

00:02:39.533 --> 00:02:40.203
Captain!

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.830
Where are you looking at?!

00:02:42.933 --> 00:02:44.003
What?!

00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:47.533
You let your guard down,
Grankingdom foot soldier!

00:02:55.533 --> 00:02:57.273
What is Andropov doing?!

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.170
Damage in the yellow zone,
the gap in forces is increasing.

00:03:00.333 --> 00:03:01.473
I suggest withdrawal.

00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:03.203
Andropov, you!

00:03:03.766 --> 00:03:05.396
Take your subordinates and withdraw.

00:03:05.433 --> 00:03:07.903
I recommend you rebuild your force.

00:03:08.466 --> 00:03:11.326
If you keep going, you will lose, Gilliam.

00:03:12.066 --> 00:03:13.066
Damn you!

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:17.100
I'll let you decide.
This is just a suggestion.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.170
All right!

00:03:33.766 --> 00:03:38.666
VANISH VANISH DON'T!

00:04:00.533 --> 00:04:01.933
Beautiful.

00:04:02.233 --> 00:04:07.773
It's perfect if I may say so myself.
I have to have it reassured today as well.

00:04:16.266 --> 00:04:18.396
Somebody?
Can somebody hear this?

00:04:19.766 --> 00:04:23.066
Point S3025 Inspection Gate.

00:04:24.166 --> 00:04:25.626
This is a line for military use.

00:04:26.166 --> 00:04:27.966
Reveal your association
and state your business.

00:04:28.766 --> 00:04:31.396
It's me, yours truly.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.130
Th-This must be Colonel Cynthia!

00:04:34.333 --> 00:04:37.503
P-Please pardon me!
What can I do for you?!

00:04:38.066 --> 00:04:42.026
Who is the most beautiful
person in this world?

00:04:42.133 --> 00:04:44.003
It is you, Colonel Cynthia.

00:04:44.666 --> 00:04:46.826
That's right, me!

00:04:47.366 --> 00:04:48.866
Well done.

00:04:50.066 --> 00:04:51.266
Say it again.

00:04:51.633 --> 00:04:53.733
- Excuse me?
- Say it one more time!

00:04:54.133 --> 00:04:57.873
Colonel Cynthia, you are the most
beautiful person in the world!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.100
That's right.
Good boy.

00:05:02.666 --> 00:05:05.966
You've got to be kidding me,
that Cynthia.

00:05:06.333 --> 00:05:07.773
I hear it happens occasionally...

00:05:07.866 --> 00:05:09.866
A random radio dispatch
from Colonel Cynthia.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:13.770
I don't understand what
high-ranking people are thinking.

00:05:14.333 --> 00:05:18.303
I can't believe they just let those
whimsical people do whatever they want.

00:05:18.666 --> 00:05:19.996
Don't complain.

00:05:20.133 --> 00:05:24.233
They're the elite Shadow Wielders of
the Independent Flying Squadron.

00:05:24.933 --> 00:05:26.673
They're different from us.

00:05:27.133 --> 00:05:30.073
Put yourself in my shoes,
having to deal with this.

00:05:30.833 --> 00:05:35.703
I'd rather communicate
with a girl like this...

00:05:36.233 --> 00:05:37.273
You're absolutely right.

00:05:45.333 --> 00:05:46.473
What's the situation
at the inspection gate?

00:05:47.233 --> 00:05:51.003
Well, there are about five soldiers.
And two of those fake Shadows, too.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.730
Then we should be able to
get through easily!

00:05:53.933 --> 00:05:57.233
Wait, that's no fun, maro.

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:59.300
Huh? What are you saying?

00:05:59.733 --> 00:06:01.773
Maroro.

00:06:05.033 --> 00:06:06.833
Maybe I should quit the military.

00:06:07.766 --> 00:06:08.996
What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:06:09.466 --> 00:06:11.066
I've been thinking about it
for a while now.

00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:13.033
Actually, I have been, too.

00:06:13.066 --> 00:06:13.726
Hi!

00:06:15.133 --> 00:06:15.803
Jiggle.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:17.170
Bounce.

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:26.870
Bouquet...

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.570
Bouquet...

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.230
Hello!

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:42.300
H-Hello...

00:06:57.966 --> 00:06:58.966
We did it!

00:06:59.833 --> 00:07:03.133
Now we can walk
right through the gate.

00:07:04.233 --> 00:07:05.373
Men.

00:07:10.266 --> 00:07:17.766
Point S3025 Inspection Gate, respond.
Point S3025 Inspection Gate, respond.

00:07:18.666 --> 00:07:20.826
This is a periodic status check.
Respond.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.500
Something wrong?

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.500
Yes! Colonel Cynthia!

00:07:27.533 --> 00:07:29.873
Colonel Cynthia,
the most beautiful lady in the world!

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:34.200
We've lost contact with
Point S3025 Inspection Gate.

00:07:34.533 --> 00:07:37.573
Point S3025? Wasn't that...

00:07:42.566 --> 00:07:44.766
There was somebody there
not too long ago...

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:47.170
That must be it.

00:07:52.666 --> 00:07:53.666
This is?!

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:01.000
Get up! What happened?!

00:08:01.766 --> 00:08:05.666
The most beautiful person
in the world is Bouquet...

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:07.200
What?

00:08:07.233 --> 00:08:08.403
Bouquet...

00:08:08.433 --> 00:08:09.433
Bouquet...

00:08:09.466 --> 00:08:10.896
Bouquet...

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.400
Who is Bouquet?!

00:08:20.466 --> 00:08:22.066
Little girl!

00:08:23.733 --> 00:08:26.033
I'll crush her!

00:08:32.466 --> 00:08:34.296
Squads Three to Five,
go to the right flank.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.330
We've won this battle...

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:42.770
Andropov! Andropov!

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.470
Cynthia, I'm in the middle of a battle.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:47.400
I don't care about that.

00:08:47.433 --> 00:08:48.473
What do you mean?

00:08:48.733 --> 00:08:49.733
I want you to come here.

00:08:49.933 --> 00:08:51.833
There's something
more interesting going on.

00:08:52.966 --> 00:08:55.596
They're here.
So I want you to help me.

00:08:57.533 --> 00:08:58.533
Got it.

00:08:59.066 --> 00:09:00.126
In that case...

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.270
Rock Weapon!

00:09:24.433 --> 00:09:25.773
It's a beautiful place.

00:09:25.966 --> 00:09:28.496
But the valley is covered in fog...

00:09:36.166 --> 00:09:38.666
Maybe that's why
it looks more beautiful...

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:41.500
I found you!

00:09:43.633 --> 00:09:46.233
Bouquet!

00:09:46.833 --> 00:09:47.833
Watch out!

00:09:49.533 --> 00:09:50.533
Blueâ€”!

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:51.370
Huh?

00:09:56.266 --> 00:09:57.266
What?

00:10:01.166 --> 00:10:04.166
Why?! Why just me?!

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:07.100
You! Moving so quickly!

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:09.800
In that case...

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.200
Impact Drive!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:24.370
Oh!

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:25.470
Oh no!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.600
No good! It's too soft!

00:10:51.133 --> 00:10:52.933
Bring out your Shadow and
get ready for impact!

00:10:53.533 --> 00:10:55.473
What?! I can't just...

00:10:55.666 --> 00:10:56.666
Hippo!

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:58.930
Boss Lady!

00:10:58.966 --> 00:11:00.866
Let's save everybody for a change!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.500
All right!

00:11:02.533 --> 00:11:08.503
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform!
Transform to a giant ball!

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:10.930
A ball!

00:11:11.666 --> 00:11:13.096
That shouldn't hurt!

00:11:13.433 --> 00:11:15.773
They're actually useful this time!

00:11:21.066 --> 00:11:21.726
Oh?

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.600
Oh, hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.270
It's heading this way!

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:29.170
Stop! Stop! Stop!

00:11:34.666 --> 00:11:37.366
Thanks for nothing!

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:41.470
Oh?

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.430
Ouch.

00:11:52.366 --> 00:11:53.696
Huh? This place is...

00:11:56.933 --> 00:11:58.933
It's a garbage dump!

00:12:02.333 --> 00:12:03.773
Andropov, can you hear me?

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:07.330
I don't know where I am.
Can you look it up?

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:28.630
I've confirmed the location...

00:12:29.533 --> 00:12:32.003
You've gotten yourself
in a troublesome location.

00:12:32.033 --> 00:12:32.703
What?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:36.430
Point S3219... It's Death Valley.

00:12:36.933 --> 00:12:37.973
Death Valley?!

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:42.200
It's home to a research facility
that was abandoned 34 years ago.

00:12:44.033 --> 00:12:45.673
- The bio-contaminants
- What is this?

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.030
- led to the development
- Help me!

00:12:47.066 --> 00:12:48.496
of some interesting new creatures.

00:12:54.166 --> 00:12:55.666
The facility's still standing today.

00:12:56.266 --> 00:12:58.326
The area is called Death Valley

00:12:59.266 --> 00:13:02.466
because it's impossible for
a normal human being to get out alive.

00:13:02.633 --> 00:13:05.573
Impossible to get out?!
You've got to be kidding me!

00:13:07.166 --> 00:13:08.896
I'll climb up here...

00:13:10.833 --> 00:13:12.403
The area's always covered in fog,

00:13:12.766 --> 00:13:14.666
the rock that forms the cliffs
is too soft to hold weight,

00:13:15.366 --> 00:13:17.396
and the whole place
is full of monsters.

00:13:18.233 --> 00:13:20.833
Even a Shadow Wielder won't
be able to get out so easily.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:25.570
N-No! Can't you do something about it?!

00:13:28.133 --> 00:13:31.033
Andropov, I love you!
Help me!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.370
Andropov, I don't love you,
so help me.

00:13:36.466 --> 00:13:37.126
I'll try.

00:13:50.233 --> 00:13:52.433
Hippo, it stinks in here.

00:13:52.966 --> 00:13:54.496
I agree.

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:59.300
Let's not stay here too long.
I'm sick of this!

00:13:59.433 --> 00:14:00.503
Somebody's coming!

00:14:07.133 --> 00:14:08.333
I feel gross...

00:14:23.733 --> 00:14:25.973
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform!

00:14:33.466 --> 00:14:34.826
Oh man...

00:14:36.366 --> 00:14:40.296
Geez...this pile of garbage
goes on forever...

00:14:41.366 --> 00:14:42.726
So heavy...

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:46.400
What if this odor won't wash off?

00:14:46.866 --> 00:14:52.196
I'm counting on you, Andropov.
Please help me escape this garbage dump.

00:14:57.866 --> 00:15:01.596
Escape?! Does she know
the way out of here?!

00:15:01.733 --> 00:15:02.403
Hippo?

00:15:02.866 --> 00:15:05.326
If we follow her,
we might be able to escape!

00:15:06.033 --> 00:15:08.273
But then how would we
let the others know?

00:15:09.666 --> 00:15:10.496
I know!

00:15:11.533 --> 00:15:12.303
Don't look!

00:15:17.566 --> 00:15:19.696
If I use my clothes as a mark...

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.400
Everybody can get out too!

00:15:24.833 --> 00:15:26.903
Hey, stop it!

00:15:28.666 --> 00:15:30.966
Blue Dragon!

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.000
Yeah!

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:48.170
W-What is it?

00:15:48.466 --> 00:15:51.026
Don't use me so conveniently.

00:15:53.566 --> 00:15:54.226
Shu!

00:15:55.166 --> 00:15:56.166
Zola!

00:16:15.133 --> 00:16:16.603
Minotaur!

00:16:23.233 --> 00:16:24.233
Hey!

00:16:26.433 --> 00:16:28.073
Help me!

00:16:35.966 --> 00:16:37.796
Once you're past the forest,
you'll see a hill.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.570
Cynthia, can you hear me?

00:16:41.966 --> 00:16:43.466
I can hear you!

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:49.030
Come on. He calls this a rescue,
but all he's doing is leading the way.

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.870
Help!

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:30.830
I'm disappearing! Disappear!

00:17:39.833 --> 00:17:43.533
S-Stop it! I don't taste good!

00:17:45.833 --> 00:17:48.173
Maro!

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:53.700
I'm falling!

00:17:54.133 --> 00:17:55.173
Maro!

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:56.330
Marumaro!

00:17:57.066 --> 00:17:58.066
Are we all here?

00:17:58.200 --> 00:17:59.400
Bouquet isn't here yet.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:00.430
Let's look for her.

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:01.370
- Right!
- Right!

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:05.770
What? Almost there?
I hope so...

00:18:09.166 --> 00:18:11.896
The grass is hitting my butt
and it's tickling me...

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.070
Somebody there?!

00:18:20.533 --> 00:18:21.703
Maybe not...

00:18:25.766 --> 00:18:26.766
This is...

00:18:27.066 --> 00:18:27.726
Maro?

00:18:28.033 --> 00:18:29.033
These are Bouquet's...

00:18:30.266 --> 00:18:31.966
Was she attacked and
forced to take them off?

00:18:32.433 --> 00:18:34.473
No, it's neatly folded.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.930
It looks like it's pointing that way.

00:18:37.866 --> 00:18:38.866
You're right.

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:43.270
It seems like Bouquet is trying to
tell us something.

00:18:44.233 --> 00:18:44.903
Let's go.

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:51.500
This is!

00:18:56.133 --> 00:19:00.103
Andropov, thank you!
I've managed to escape from Death Valley!

00:19:00.566 --> 00:19:01.826
No need to thank me.

00:19:01.966 --> 00:19:04.796
I can't do that. At least let me
kiss you to show my gratitude.

00:19:07.766 --> 00:19:09.366
How rude.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:17.170
Oh...

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:18.470
Oh?

00:19:24.133 --> 00:19:25.873
This is horrible...

00:19:25.966 --> 00:19:29.366
My beauty is totally ruined!

00:19:30.066 --> 00:19:32.696
I have to go back and
take another bath!

00:19:32.733 --> 00:19:33.733
Sneak...

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:37.470
I don't want to see anybody
at a time like this.

00:19:37.866 --> 00:19:39.996
Come on, seriously...

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.600
What is it?!

00:19:52.333 --> 00:19:53.873
So there is somebody here!

00:20:06.733 --> 00:20:09.133
Maro!

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:12.070
Huh?!

00:20:14.633 --> 00:20:15.303
Oh...

00:20:15.833 --> 00:20:16.503
Oh...

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:17.670
Bouquet...

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:24.900
The most beautiful woman in the world...
is not you!

00:20:25.733 --> 00:20:28.173
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform!

00:20:28.633 --> 00:20:29.633
Anchor!

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:32.570
What?!

00:20:40.166 --> 00:20:42.696
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform!

00:20:42.866 --> 00:20:44.266
Tuna fish, hipo!

00:20:48.733 --> 00:20:53.503
You!
Don't get so carried away!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.870
Ouch...

00:21:10.066 --> 00:21:13.166
I'll take good care of you...

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:17.170
Cynthia.

00:21:18.533 --> 00:21:20.233
What do you want at a time like this?

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:21.470
The enemy.

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:22.170
What?!

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:25.870
Bouquet!

00:21:26.166 --> 00:21:28.096
- Everybody!
- Hipo!

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:32.230
It might be difficult to fight that many
enemies outside of the valley,

00:21:32.266 --> 00:21:34.396
but if you want to take them on,
I'll back you up.

00:21:36.766 --> 00:21:37.966
All right...

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:45.900
Just remember this, the most beautiful
woman in this world...is me!

00:21:51.166 --> 00:21:53.396
W-We're saved...

00:21:54.233 --> 00:21:55.803
What was that?

00:21:58.700 --> 00:21:59.700
Thanks for waiting!

00:22:00.133 --> 00:22:01.733
That was clever of you.

00:22:02.066 --> 00:22:05.666
Definitely. We were able to get out
of the valley without getting lost.

00:22:07.566 --> 00:22:08.696
Hey you!

00:22:09.966 --> 00:22:11.566
What is this?!

00:22:16.533 --> 00:22:18.803
It's my bra!

00:22:18.833 --> 00:22:22.703
If you want it back,
let me touch your boobs!

00:22:22.733 --> 00:22:24.933
Hey! Give it back!

00:22:32.866 --> 00:22:34.196
Now, let's go.

00:24:21.800 --> 00:24:23.600
Searching for the next information,

00:24:23.633 --> 00:24:25.773
Homeron heads to the sky
with everyone's support.

00:24:25.833 --> 00:24:29.433
Leave it to me, Homeron!
Now, please get inside this barrel!

00:24:29.533 --> 00:24:32.133
Hey, Shu! Isn't that a barrel
you use to launch fireworks?

00:24:32.166 --> 00:24:34.496
Good thinking!
All right, I'll help out too!

00:24:34.566 --> 00:24:35.696
Tamaya!

00:24:35.733 --> 00:24:37.373
Kagiya!

00:24:37.400 --> 00:24:39.630
Next on Blue Dragon:
Towards the Great Blue Sky
